<Layout
  title="Day Calculator Privacy Policy — barreeyentos"
  description="Privacy policy for the Day Calculator application."
  pageTitle="Day Calculator"
  centerTitle={true}
>
  <h2 style="text-align:center;">Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p>
    This policy applies to all information collected or submitted on the Day
    Calculator application for iPhone and any other devices and platforms.
    Throughout this page the use of "the App" or "the Application" refer to the
    Day Calculator application.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    The App does not require an account and does not collect any personal
    information.
  </p>

  <h3>Ads and analytics</h3>
  <p>
    The App may collect aggregate, anonymous statistics, such as the percentage
    of users who use particular features, to improve the app.
  </p>
  <p>No personal data is used to target ads.</p>

  <h2>Information usage</h2>
  <p>
    We use the information we collect to operate and improve our website, apps,
    and customer support.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not share personal information with outside parties except to the
    extent necessary to accomplish the App's functionality.
  </p>
  <p>
    We may disclose your information in response to subpoenas, court orders, or
    other legal requirements; to exercise our legal rights or defend against
    legal claims; to investigate, prevent, or take action regarding illegal
    activities, suspected fraud or abuse, violations of our policies; or to
    protect our rights and property.
  </p>
  <p>
    In the future, we may seek to buy, sell, merge with, or partner with other
    businesses. In such transactions, user information may be among the
    transferred assets.
  </p>

  <h2>California Online Privacy Protection Act Compliance</h2>
  <p>
    We comply with the California Online Privacy Protection Act. We therefore
    will not distribute your personal information to outside parties without
    your consent.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's Online Privacy Protection Act Compliance</h2>
  <p>
    We never collect or maintain information at our website from those we
    actually know are under 13, and no part of our website is structured to
    attract anyone under 13.
  </p>

  <h2>Information for European Union Customers</h2>
  <p>
    By using the App and providing your information, you authorize us to
    collect, use, and store your information outside of the European Union.
  </p>

  <h2>International Transfers of Information</h2>
  <p>
    Information may be processed, stored, and used outside of the country in
    which you are located. Data privacy laws vary across jurisdictions, and
    different laws may be applicable to your data depending on where it is
    processed, stored, or used.
  </p>

  <h2>Your Consent</h2>
  <p>By using the Application, you consent to this privacy policy.</p>

  <h2>Contacting Us</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions regarding this privacy policy, you may email
    <a href="mailto:apps@barreeyentos.io">apps@barreeyentos.io</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If we decide to change our privacy policy, we will post those changes on
    this page. Summary of changes so far:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>September 13, 2020:</strong> First published.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
